  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bini Sunil vs Corporation Of Kochi on 9 February, 2024 Author: Murali Purushothaman Bench: Murali Purushothaman IN THE HIGH COURT OF KERALA AT ERNAKULAM PRESENT THE HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE MURALI PURUSHOTHAMAN FRIDAY, THE 9TH DAY OF FEBRUARY 2024 / 20TH MAGHA, 1945 WP(C) NO. 5056 OF 2024 PETITIONER: BINI SUNIL AGED 45 YEARS W/O. SUNIL THOMAS, CHANDRANKUNNEL HOUSE, ANRA 22, AISWARYA NAGAR, CHOORAKKAD, THRIPUNITHURA, ERNAKULAM, KOCHI, PIN - 682 301. BY ADV PRAMOD KOCHUTHOMMEN EELIAS RESPONDENTS: 1 CORPORATION OF KOCHI PARK AVENUE, ERNAKULAM HEAD POST OFFICE P.O., ERNAKULAM DISTRICT, REPRESENTED BY ITS SECRETARY, PIN - 682 011. 2 SECRETARY CORPORATION OF KOCHI, PARK AVENUE, ERNAKULAM HEAD POST OFFICE P.O., ERNAKULAM DISTRICT, PIN - 682 011. 3 THE HEALTH INSPECTOR CIRCLE NO.17, CORPORATION OF KOCHI, PARK AVENUE, ERNAKULAM HEAD POST OFFICE P.O., ERNAKULAM DISTRICT, PIN - 682 011. 4 DILIP KUMAR T.P S/O. PARAMESWARAN T.K., ASHIQ BHAVANAM, VILLA NO.15 VINAYAKA PALACE, NADAMA VILLAGE, KANAYANNUR TALUK, ERNAKULAM DISTRICT, KOCHI, PIN - 682 306. SRI. R.HARISHANKAR - SC SMT. DEVISHRI - GP Bini Sunil vs Corporation Of Kochi on 9 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/177758683/ 1 THIS WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) HAVING COME UP FOR ADMISSION ON 09.02.2024, THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING: WP(C).No.5056 OF 2024 2 JUDGMENT",
    "facts": "The petitioner is the tenant in the building bearing No.50/174-E, F of Kochi Corporation. The petitioner is running a restaurant in the said building. The petitioner has been issued with Ext.P8 notice by the 3rd respondent stating that the petitioner is running the business without IFTE and OS licence.",
